<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" article-type="correction"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">Pharm Res</journal-id><journal-title>Pharmaceutical Research</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0724-8741</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1573-904X</issn><publisher><publisher-name>Kluwer Academic Publishers-Plenum Publishers</publisher-name><publisher-loc>New York</publisher-loc></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">1915589</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">9261</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s11095-007-9261-0</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Erratum</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Performance of an Iterative Two-stage Bayesian Technique for Population Pharmacokinetic Analysis of Rich Data Sets</article-title></title-group><contrib-group><contrib contrib-type="author" corresp="yes"><name name-style="western"><surname>Proost</surname><given-names>Johannes H.</given-names></name><address><phone>+31-50-3633292</phone><fax>+31-50-3633247</fax><email>j.h.proost@rug.nl</email></address><xref ref-type="aff" rid="Aff1">1</xref><xref ref-type="aff" rid="Aff2">2</xref></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name name-style="western"><surname>Eleveld</surname><given-names>Douglas J.</given-names></name><xref ref-type="aff" rid="Aff1">1</xref></contrib><aff id="Aff1"><label>1</label>Research Group for Experimental Anesthesiology and Clinical Pharmacology, Department of Anesthesiology, University Medical Center Groningen, University of Groningen, PO Box 30001, 9700 RB Groningen, The Netherlands </aff><aff id="Aff2"><label>2</label>Department of Pharmacokinetics and Drug Delivery, University Centre for Pharmacy, University of Groningen, Groningen, The Netherlands </aff></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="epub"><day>23</day><month>3</month><year>2007</year></pub-date><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><month>8</month><year>2007</year></pub-date><volume>24</volume><issue>8</issue><fpage>1599</fpage><lpage>1599</lpage><history><date date-type="received"><day>15</day><month>1</month><year>2007</year></date><date date-type="accepted"><day>1</day><month>2</month><year>2007</year></date></history><permissions><copyright-statement>&#x000a9; Springer Science+Business Media, LLC 2007</copyright-statement></permissions><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" id="N0x1c3e590N0x2cc3480" ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1007/s11095-006-9116-0"/><custom-meta-wrap><custom-meta><meta-name>issue-copyright-statement</meta-name><meta-value>&#x000a9; Springer Science+Business Media, LLC 2007</meta-value></custom-meta></custom-meta-wrap></article-meta></front><body><p>In the December 2006 issue of <italic>Pharmaceutical Research</italic> (Vol. 23, No. 12, pages 2748&#x02013;2759), there occurred two errors in the above manuscript. The correct information is as follows: <list list-type="order"><list-item><p>Equation (6) that appeared on page 2750 is incorrect. The correct equation for the calculation of the elements of matrix [<italic>&#x003b1;</italic><sub><italic>k</italic></sub>] is shown below: <disp-formula id="Equa"><tex-math id="M1">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}\usepackage{amsmath}\usepackage{wasysym} \usepackage{amsfonts} \usepackage{amssymb} \usepackage{amsbsy}\usepackage{mathrsfs}\usepackage{upgreek}\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}\begin{document}$$ \alpha _{{k,p,q}} = {\sum\limits_{i = 1}^{n_{k} } {{\left\{ {\frac{1} {{\sigma ^{2}_{{{\text{res}},k,i}} }}\frac{{\partial Y_{{{\text{calc}},k,i}} }} {{\partial P_{p} }}\frac{{\partial Y_{{{\text{calc}},k,i}} }} {{\partial P_{q} }}} \right\}}} } + {\left[ {{\text{COV}}_{{{\text{pop}}}} } \right]}^{{ - 1}}_{{p,q}} $$\end{document}</tex-math></disp-formula></p></list-item><list-item><p>The author of reference 6 is S. Guzy.</p></list-item></list></p></body><back><fn-group><fn><p>The online version of the original article can be found at: 10.1007/s11095-006-9116-0.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>